    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kinumunumae ŋasuban a Paska",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yosia kitiya ŋasuban ŋuna a Paska aŋuna ke Ekapolon alo Yerusalem. Apotu ŋituŋa a Yosia toara ŋibaren ŋulu a ŋasuban a Paska erae ŋirwa ke elap ŋitomon ka ŋiomwon elap ŋolo ke epei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yosia kiwuanak ŋisacaradotin loticisyo kec, ido kisimukek ikes akitiya etic ŋolo ka Akai ke Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok ŋilepi ŋulu etatamete Ŋisirael daadaŋ ka ŋulu aris kitaleun neni ke Ekapolon ebe, “Kiwuakisi Asaduku ŋina asegan ŋina ka Acamunet Kai ka Akuj ŋina abu Solomon lokoku a Daudi ŋolo arae erwosit toduk; nyemaikina iyes torubakis iryoŋito iŋes. Kitiyanakisi tokona Ekapolon Akuj kus ka ŋituŋa keŋ Ŋisirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitemonokinos tokona a ŋatekerin kus ka a ŋatutubeta kus lopite ŋolo ikilimokinitere anakiro a ŋuna igirit Daudi erwosit ŋolo a Ŋisirael ka ŋuna igirit Solomon lokoku keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toloto towua alo Kai ka Akuj a ŋatekerin a ŋituŋa kus, ido emaikina ŋilepi eyakasi natukot a ŋulutuŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toara ŋikaalei ŋulu a ŋasuban a Paska, kitaleutu ŋawat kus ka kitemonokisi ŋibaren aŋuna a ŋituŋa ka akwap kus, kitiyata ŋun lopite ŋolo elimunitor Ekapolon aneni a Moses.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Yosia tolemu ŋainakineta ŋuna a Paska aŋuna a ŋituŋa a ŋuluce a daadaŋ a ŋulu aya nen, tolemu ŋikaalei ŋulumesekin ka ŋulumee ŋalipyo ŋatomoniuni, tolemu ŋimoŋin ŋalipyo ŋauni; alemunio ŋibaren ŋul daadaŋ alobaren a Yosia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋikapolok ŋulu epukatotor Yosia daŋ tolemut a acamit kec ŋainakineta aŋuna a ŋituŋa ka aŋuna a ŋisacaradotin ta aŋuna a ŋilepi. Apotu Ilika ka Sakariya ta Yeiel, ŋulu apolokinito ŋiticisyo ŋulu ka Akai ka Akuj tolemut aŋuna a ŋisacaradotin ŋainakineta kec ŋuna a Paska ŋikaalei ŋulumesekin ka ŋulumee ŋalipyo ŋaarei ka ŋamiae ŋakanikapei ta ŋimoŋin ŋamiae ŋauni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu daŋ ŋikarikok a ŋilepi Konania ka ŋikaitotoi keŋ lu: Semaia, Nesanel, Asabia ka Yeiel ta Yosabad tolemut aŋuna a ŋilepi ŋainakineta kec ŋuna a Paska, ŋikaalei ŋulumesekin ka ŋulumee ŋalipyo ŋakan ka ŋimoŋin ŋamiae ŋakan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kirikakin akitemonokin ibore daadaŋ, apotu ŋisacaradotin towua anakiboisyo kec, towua ŋilepi daŋ a ŋatukon kec, lopite ŋolo alimunitor erwosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toarae nai ŋikaalei ŋulu a Paska, towuatanakis ŋisacaradotin Namuroet ŋaokot ŋuna ainakinio ikes, ido toyeŋa ŋilepi ŋibaren ŋul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ikes tosetasi nawae ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo aŋuna ka ainakin neni a ŋatuketa a ŋatekerin, ikotere ŋun eayete neni ke Ekapolon, ikwapei igiritere lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋikisila a Moses. Apotu ikes kitiyata ikwaŋinapei neni a ŋimoŋin a ŋulu ayaunitae erae ŋainakineta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Topeo ŋilepi ŋibaren ŋulu a Paska ŋul, iwuapito ŋikisila, ido kipoto a ŋamoti, a ŋidaramwa ka a ŋasipiryae ŋainakineta ke etal, tokorakis nai atipei akiriŋ lotuŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedaut ŋilepi etic ŋol daadaŋ, apotu kitemonokis akiriŋ aŋuna kec ka aŋuna a ŋisacaradotin a ŋiletok ka Aron, anerae atiŋiyara ŋisacaradotin alotic akitodol ŋina awaria akwap, apeyete ikes ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo ka apeyete ŋasepwa ŋuna amaikina topeoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, ayakasi ŋikaeok ŋulu anateker ka Asap kaapei ka ŋilepi ŋuluce nakiboisyo ŋuna amaikina ikes eyakasi, lopite ŋolo alimunitor Daudi. Ŋilepi ŋulu arae ŋikaeok ikes Asap ka Eman ta Yedusun eketeyenikinan ŋolo a erwosit. Ayakasi daŋ ŋiketeok ŋipukei a Akai ka Akuj lopukei ŋulu ewuakinitae ikes. Apotu ŋul daadaŋ torubakis eyakasi nen, anerae etemonokinete ŋilepi ŋuluce ŋasuban a Paska aŋuna kec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, aponi ibore daadaŋ kitiyae akoloŋit ŋin aŋuna ka kilip neni a Ekapolon, ikotere erubakinio itiyaeneneo ŋasuban ŋuna a Paska ka eayeneneo ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo Namuroet ŋina ke Ekapolon lopite ŋolo alimunitor erwosit Yosia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Ŋisirael ŋulu ayakasi nen kitiyata ŋasuban ŋuna a Paska apaki ŋin ka ŋasuban ŋuna a ŋamugati a ŋuna emam ŋakinyalet, kitiyata ikes ŋasuban ŋuna a ŋamugati a ŋuna emam ŋakinyalet todol ŋirwa ŋikanikaarei itiyaete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mam ŋasuban a Paska ŋuna ekwaan ka ŋun ŋuna keponi kitiyae alo Isirael mati ŋuna a ŋirwa a ŋulu a Samuel a ekadwaran; mam epei daŋ alorwosi a Ŋisirael ŋolo kebu kitiya ŋasuban ŋuna a Paska, lopite ŋolo abunio Yosia kitiyaata ka ŋisacaradotin, ŋilepi ka ŋituŋa a Yudaya ka ŋulu a Isirael ta ŋulu eboiyete alo Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etiyao ŋasuban ŋun edolete ŋikaru ŋulu epukator Yosia Yudaya ŋitomon ka ŋikanikauni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kilou Parao Neko akwap a Yudaya ka toarae Yosia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedau erwosit Yosia akitiya ŋakiro ŋun daadaŋ aŋuna ka Akai ka Akuj, abu Neko erwosit a Ijipit tolot akitijiore ŋituŋa a Yosia aneni anyaritae Karikemis alodiyete aŋolol Eupurate. Abu Yosia tolot lojie ŋol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai kebu Neko kiyakiya ŋituŋa neni a Yosia tema, “Alibura eyai kidiŋ iyoŋ ka ayoŋ erwosit a Yudaya? Nyabunit ayoŋ neni kon nakoloŋit na, nai abunit ayoŋ akitijiore ŋituŋa ŋulu erae ŋimoe kaŋ; akalimoki Akuj ayoŋ akitiya ŋun atipei. Toesik akitepeg Akuj ŋina ikirukit ka ayoŋ, ikotere nyikimunya iyes.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu Yosia toŋer akimyekin Neko, kitusubun meere erwosit aŋuna ka akitijikin Neko, toŋer akiirar ŋakiro ŋuna erworo Akuj aneni a Neko. Abu tolot kitijikis Neko anakadipaalat a ŋina a Megido. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toguma Ŋijipitian Yosia a ekaleŋeleŋet, tolimok Yosia ŋikapolok a ŋasigarya keŋ tema, “Yaarae ayoŋ a ne, akawani ayoŋ nooi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu ŋasigarya keŋ todakasi iŋes anagaari keŋ a ŋina sek ayai, kiwuakis nagaari keŋ ace yaut Yerusalem neni abu totwanik. Aponi tonukae iŋes neni anukitae atapapaa keŋ. Apotu ŋituŋa a Yudaya ka ŋulu a Yerusalem daadaŋ kigworo aŋuna a Yosia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
