        {
          "text": "Abu Yeremia toe ŋieosyo ŋulu kigworet aŋuna a Yosia ka akitodol akoloŋit na, eosi ŋikilyok ka ŋaberu ŋulu eyenete aeo ŋieosyo ŋul etamunito Yosia, apotu kituruwosi ŋun etal alo Isirael ka igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋieosyo a ŋulu ka akiwolol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.25",
