              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo a Yosia ŋuluce daadaŋ, ŋakiro ŋuna ka anupit keŋ nooi neni a Ekapolon, akiwuapit keŋ nooi ŋikisila a Ekapolon ŋulu egiritae lokitaabo ",
          "type": "text",
